Based on github.com/coder/websocket v1.8.15, retaining its MIT license.

Campfire adds prepared.go and prepared_test.go. PreparedMessage shares immutable
payloads and lazily compressed bytes across server connections negotiating
permessage-deflate without context takeover. Other connection modes use Write.
The existing frame writer still handles locking, cancellation and close state.
No upstream Go source files were changed. Upstream tests run in bin/check.
